    "title": "MICROSERVICE-batchinsertion-Create Pharmacy Prescriptions Refill-v1-spec",
    "description": "This API facilitates the refill of pharmacy prescriptions in bulk. It allows authorized users, such as pharmacies and healthcare providers, to efficiently manage prescription refills to ensure patients receive their medications on time. The endpoint supports batch processing of refill requests, reducing the manual effort and potential errors associated with individual refills. Typical consumers include pharmacy management systems and prescription management applications that aim to streamline pharmacy operations.",
